WEBVTT

00:00:05.990 --> 00:00:16.730
<i>Along a zigzag the world turns,</i>
<i>I heave out a sigh.</i>

00:00:16.840 --> 00:00:27.680
<i>Someone pauses along the way,</i>
<i>but reality moves on.</i>

00:00:27.920 --> 00:00:33.210
<i>Treat love as love, treat</i>
<i>dreams as dreams.</i>

00:00:33.320 --> 00:00:38.720
<i>It's difficult to say it in earnest.</i>
<i>The times forge ahead, but...</i>

00:00:38.830 --> 00:00:43.700
<i>I want to make you happy...</i>

00:00:43.830 --> 00:00:49.500
<i>I'll do so like I do to</i>
<i>be myself. Yeah!</i>

00:00:49.600 --> 00:00:54.530
<i>I'll make you happy...</i>

00:00:54.640 --> 00:00:59.940
<i>I dedicate all that</i>
<i>I can do to you.</i>

00:01:00.050 --> 00:01:11.260
<i>Along a zigzag the world turns,</i>
<i>I heave out a sigh.</i>

00:01:11.330 --> 00:01:23.440
<i>Someone pauses along the way,</i>
<i>but love doesn't stop for me.</i>

00:01:36.920 --> 00:01:38.850
"Bokuto Station"

00:01:42.660 --> 00:01:46.460
Come on, Natsumi. You're always
late at times like these.

00:01:46.560 --> 00:01:48.530
Here she
comes!

00:01:52.070 --> 00:01:55.190
Natsumi! What happened
to you, Natsumi?

00:01:55.670 --> 00:01:57.190
I feel terrible!

00:01:58.010 --> 00:01:59.910
Hung over
again?

00:02:00.010 --> 00:02:02.810
Why does this always happen
at important times?

00:02:02.980 --> 00:02:04.310
Huh? What?

00:02:04.580 --> 00:02:09.380
FILE. 6
INSPECTOR ARIZUKA -
THE KING OF HADES

00:02:10.590 --> 00:02:13.420
I didn't ask you all to gather
here for no reason.

00:02:13.520 --> 00:02:17.550
This is sudden, but an inspector from
headquarters is coming today.

00:02:18.390 --> 00:02:20.520
His name is Inspector
Arizuka...

00:02:20.630 --> 00:02:24.120
...and he was an instructor when
I was at the Police Academy.

00:02:25.730 --> 00:02:28.530
I'm not asking for
anything special.

00:02:28.640 --> 00:02:30.470
I just want to make sure that
we don't do anything...

00:02:30.570 --> 00:02:33.600
...that will give him a negative
impression of us.

00:02:33.710 --> 00:02:36.770
Especially you two... Tsujimoto and
Kobayakawa.

00:02:36.940 --> 00:02:38.640
Yeah...

00:02:38.810 --> 00:02:41.650
I implore you to be on
your best behavior.

00:02:44.350 --> 00:02:48.190
Urk... Where's
the Chief?

00:02:48.360 --> 00:02:50.290
He went to pick up
the Inspector.

00:02:50.460 --> 00:02:53.860
He won't be too impressed
if he sees all this.

00:02:54.030 --> 00:02:56.020
Especially the King
of Hades himself.

00:02:56.200 --> 00:02:57.560
Huh?

00:02:57.730 --> 00:03:01.530
I... l'm beginning to see
visions of hell.

00:03:01.700 --> 00:03:04.300
Aren't you overreacting
a bit, Yoriko?

00:03:04.470 --> 00:03:07.270
That's right. We just have
to be ourselves.

00:03:07.440 --> 00:03:11.380
N... None of you know anything
about the King of Hades.

00:03:11.480 --> 00:03:15.310
We must do something quick, or we'll
all end up getting banished!

00:03:15.650 --> 00:03:16.670
"Banished?"

00:03:16.850 --> 00:03:18.410
You mean like to
Devil's Island?

00:03:18.590 --> 00:03:21.820
Is the Inspector
that terrifying?

00:03:22.390 --> 00:03:24.860
He's called the Devil
King of HQ...

00:03:24.960 --> 00:03:28.660
...he carries his "Arizuka File" with
him all over the country...

00:03:28.760 --> 00:03:31.820
...and he's sometimes called
the Inspector from Hell.

00:03:31.930 --> 00:03:34.800
Once he sets his sights
on you, you're finished.

00:03:34.900 --> 00:03:39.310
It's said that you will never return
alive from the Bowels of Hell.

00:03:39.740 --> 00:03:43.230
How can there be
such a thing?

00:03:43.410 --> 00:03:47.210
It's true! There was a victim
recently in Otowa.

00:03:47.380 --> 00:03:48.870
That's just some crazy
rumor, I bet.

00:03:49.050 --> 00:03:50.750
Do you know anything
about this, Nakajima?

00:03:50.920 --> 00:03:54.580
Well... I seem to recall some-
thing like that, but...

00:03:55.360 --> 00:03:58.520
Think about it. Where else
are you going to find...

00:03:58.630 --> 00:04:02.030
...a transvestite or a hung
over policewoman?

00:04:02.760 --> 00:04:04.090
How embarrassing...

00:04:04.270 --> 00:04:07.530
Anyway, I think we're going to have
to hide Tsujimoto somewhere.

00:04:08.740 --> 00:04:11.970
Hey, enjoying yourselves,
wasting your youth?

00:04:12.370 --> 00:04:15.340
Y... Yes, sir, just fine,
thank you.

00:04:16.740 --> 00:04:18.710
Get it together...

00:04:20.150 --> 00:04:22.080
You say Inspector Arizuka
is coming?

00:04:22.180 --> 00:04:24.010
Well, that's
tough.

00:04:24.190 --> 00:04:25.780
So, the rumors
are true...

00:04:25.950 --> 00:04:28.050
I don't know the
details...

00:04:28.160 --> 00:04:31.020
...but more than a few have
fallen victim to him.

00:04:31.290 --> 00:04:32.850
Aha, so it's true!

00:04:33.030 --> 00:04:35.720
See, I told you.

00:04:35.900 --> 00:04:38.490
Ohhh... The
pain...

00:04:38.670 --> 00:04:41.330
Anyway, we should at least
do something about her.

00:04:41.500 --> 00:04:42.660
Right.

00:04:42.840 --> 00:04:45.930
Hey, Tsujimoto's not the only
problem you've got.

00:04:46.110 --> 00:04:46.540
Huh?

00:04:46.710 --> 00:04:48.970
Take a good look
around you.

00:04:52.780 --> 00:04:53.680
Huh?

00:04:53.850 --> 00:04:58.810
Based on this mess,
nobody is safe!

00:04:58.990 --> 00:05:00.040
That's true.

00:05:00.220 --> 00:05:02.280
Well anyway, I suggest
you clean up at least...

00:05:02.390 --> 00:05:05.190
...some of the more visible
mess before he gets here.

00:05:05.830 --> 00:05:07.850
Where should
we start?

00:05:13.500 --> 00:05:16.470
What?! He's
left already?

00:05:17.640 --> 00:05:20.340
I'm sure he said he
was leaving at 9.

00:05:20.340 --> 00:05:20.410
"Reception"
"Reception"
I'm sure he said he
was leaving at 9.

00:05:20.410 --> 00:05:20.540
"Reception"
"Reception"

00:05:20.540 --> 00:05:23.970
Well, it seems the Inspector
is at it again.
"Reception"
"Reception"

00:05:23.970 --> 00:05:23.980
Well, it seems the Inspector
is at it again.

00:05:24.150 --> 00:05:26.050
Don't take
it so hard.

00:05:26.150 --> 00:05:28.950
The Inspector likes to go around
behind people's backs.

00:05:29.550 --> 00:05:32.520
That means... he's
there now.

00:05:32.650 --> 00:05:33.950
We're screwed...

00:05:36.220 --> 00:05:37.560
Bokuto Station.

00:05:37.560 --> 00:05:38.190
Good.

00:05:38.190 --> 00:05:39.520
"lnternal Inspection Records"
Bokuto Station.

00:05:46.230 --> 00:05:48.200
Good work.

00:05:51.440 --> 00:05:53.200
Well, that's it for
this room.

00:05:53.310 --> 00:05:55.170
How's it going over
there, Yoriko?

00:05:55.340 --> 00:05:57.330
I'm finished.

00:05:57.510 --> 00:05:58.880
That's it for
me, too.

00:05:59.050 --> 00:05:59.840
Way to go.

00:06:00.010 --> 00:06:01.780
Everything's all
in order, guys.

00:06:02.320 --> 00:06:05.150
Wow! It looks just like
a police station.

00:06:05.320 --> 00:06:07.410
Don't be silly.

00:06:07.590 --> 00:06:09.220
All we have
left is...

00:06:09.390 --> 00:06:12.790
Natsumi Tsujimoto - Present.
I'll go and hide...

00:06:12.990 --> 00:06:17.690
Now you, Aoi. Just try
to stay out of sight.

00:06:17.870 --> 00:06:20.490
There'll be big trouble if he
finds out you're a man.

00:06:20.670 --> 00:06:23.800
I even put on make up.
What a letdown.

00:06:24.840 --> 00:06:26.500
Come on...

00:06:26.610 --> 00:06:28.040
That's typical
of you.

00:06:28.210 --> 00:06:29.410
The Devil King is coming!

00:06:29.410 --> 00:06:29.900
Oh, no!

00:06:30.080 --> 00:06:31.600
We have to hide
Natsumi!

00:06:33.310 --> 00:06:34.540
He's coming!

00:06:45.790 --> 00:06:47.500
Where is your Section Chief?

00:06:47.500 --> 00:06:48.430
Sir?

00:06:48.430 --> 00:06:50.230
Isn't he with you?

00:06:50.400 --> 00:06:53.460
Heh. Typical. Hasn't
changed a bit.

00:06:54.670 --> 00:06:56.540
Well, then, let's begin.

00:06:56.540 --> 00:06:57.570
What shall we do?

00:06:57.570 --> 00:07:00.230
You should know, the inspection.

00:07:03.240 --> 00:07:06.210
A slapdash cleaning job...
And let's see...

00:07:07.950 --> 00:07:10.780
Hmm, only the games
are up-to-date.

00:07:10.950 --> 00:07:11.780
No way...

00:07:11.950 --> 00:07:13.610
Didn't I tell
you?

00:07:16.860 --> 00:07:21.790
A garage kit, a toy from a game arcade,
a computer game manual. Huh?

00:07:23.400 --> 00:07:25.520
And let's see...
a gun freak.

00:07:26.900 --> 00:07:31.860
Well, you people certainly
have diverse hobbies.

00:07:37.910 --> 00:07:39.740
"Congestion; 11 km."

00:07:42.150 --> 00:07:45.880
What is it with traffic in
Japan these days?

00:07:47.590 --> 00:07:49.990
Oh no, it must have
started by now...

00:07:50.260 --> 00:07:50.660
"Traffic Department"

00:07:50.660 --> 00:07:51.760
Officer Maeda?

00:07:51.760 --> 00:07:52.860
Off-duty.

00:07:52.860 --> 00:07:53.830
Officer Higuchi?

00:07:53.830 --> 00:07:55.660
He's on patrol.

00:07:55.660 --> 00:07:57.100
Officer Yamaguchi?

00:07:57.100 --> 00:07:58.600
Also on patrol.

00:07:58.600 --> 00:08:00.970
Officer Tsujimoto?

00:08:01.340 --> 00:08:02.170
Huh?

00:08:02.170 --> 00:08:03.160
Well...

00:08:03.340 --> 00:08:07.140
Tsujimoto went with the Section
Chief to pick you up.

00:08:07.310 --> 00:08:09.570
Is that right?

00:08:09.680 --> 00:08:11.270
Well.

00:08:11.450 --> 00:08:13.140
You must be
finished.

00:08:13.310 --> 00:08:14.650
It has been an honor to have you visit!

00:08:14.650 --> 00:08:17.620
What? We've only just begun.

00:08:17.790 --> 00:08:19.950
Huh?

00:08:20.120 --> 00:08:22.720
I would now like to
tour the station.

00:08:22.890 --> 00:08:24.880
Excuse me.

00:08:25.060 --> 00:08:26.990
Kobayakawa, wasn't it?

00:08:27.090 --> 00:08:27.960
Yes, sir.

00:08:28.060 --> 00:08:30.860
I'd like you to show me around.

00:08:31.300 --> 00:08:33.600
Well then, please
come this way.

00:08:33.700 --> 00:08:36.470
Ah, Inspector?

00:08:40.240 --> 00:08:42.510
Okay, he's
gone.

00:08:42.680 --> 00:08:44.170
Are you okay,
Natsumi?

00:08:44.350 --> 00:08:49.150
Ehh... I'm hot, it stinks,
it's cramped...

00:08:49.250 --> 00:08:51.310
...and I'm going
to die.

00:08:51.490 --> 00:08:54.350
You'll have to put up with it. It's
better than getting banished.

00:08:54.660 --> 00:08:59.560
I'm beginning to disagree
with that.

00:08:59.730 --> 00:09:02.420
We'll check on
you later.

00:09:09.440 --> 00:09:12.530
Hmm... It looks very
well cared for.

00:09:13.440 --> 00:09:16.070
Are you the one looking
after this vehicle?

00:09:16.240 --> 00:09:17.710
Yes, sir.

00:09:17.880 --> 00:09:22.440
I'd like to say that this is a job well-
done. But I think you overdid it.

00:09:22.620 --> 00:09:25.380
Yes, sir. I'm
very sorry.

00:09:28.920 --> 00:09:30.490
Here he comes.

00:09:30.490 --> 00:09:32.190
I never thought he'd check the cars.

00:09:32.190 --> 00:09:34.160
Just like they said!

00:09:37.770 --> 00:09:39.320
I think we'd better
start packing.

00:09:39.500 --> 00:09:41.930
I'm so nervous...

00:09:42.100 --> 00:09:45.400
What on earth is the Section Chief
doing at a time like this?

00:09:45.670 --> 00:09:47.570
"Traffic Congestion; 12 km."

00:09:52.480 --> 00:09:55.450
If only I could use the siren
to get out of this jam...

00:09:56.750 --> 00:09:59.690
...but I mustn't.

00:10:02.890 --> 00:10:07.550
It must be the station calling. Something
must have happened.

00:10:09.000 --> 00:10:13.700
I really should answer it, but I'm
not supposed to while driving.

00:10:14.370 --> 00:10:17.800
That's strange. It does
seem to be ringing.

00:10:17.970 --> 00:10:20.240
And at a time
like this.

00:10:20.410 --> 00:10:21.710
What should we do?

00:10:21.710 --> 00:10:24.200
Well, I don't know...

00:10:24.380 --> 00:10:26.310
Hey, where's Aoi?

00:10:26.480 --> 00:10:29.470
Huh? She was here
just a second ago.

00:10:29.650 --> 00:10:31.120
Uh, that room is...

00:10:31.390 --> 00:10:34.120
"Men's Locker Room"

00:10:39.160 --> 00:10:39.330
"Sleeping Quarters"

00:10:39.330 --> 00:10:41.330
Let's look
in here.

00:10:41.330 --> 00:10:42.290
"Sleeping Quarters"

00:10:46.430 --> 00:10:48.660
Uh... Where to
next, sir?

00:10:49.800 --> 00:10:52.700
I just have to use
the facilities.

00:10:52.810 --> 00:10:53.860
Are you going to
follow me in?

00:10:54.040 --> 00:10:56.070
No! Take
your time.

00:11:04.450 --> 00:11:07.010
Wha... What
is this?!

00:11:07.390 --> 00:11:09.290
I have never seen any-
thing like this!

00:11:09.390 --> 00:11:12.220
A complete disregard for cleanliness and
bringing in personal items is one thing...

00:11:12.330 --> 00:11:15.630
...but a police officer who lies about
his gender is beyond outrageous!

00:11:16.730 --> 00:11:20.060
To think that public servants, whose
mission is to protect society...

00:11:20.770 --> 00:11:23.260
Huh? Don't tell me
there's more.

00:11:23.500 --> 00:11:24.560
Oh, no!

00:11:26.440 --> 00:11:28.570
Huh?!

00:11:33.180 --> 00:11:34.670
We're definitely
screwed.

00:11:34.850 --> 00:11:36.910
We're all headed
for the boonies.

00:11:38.890 --> 00:11:40.510
I can't hold it in...

00:11:40.690 --> 00:11:41.950
Argh!

00:11:42.120 --> 00:11:44.090
What a disaster.

00:11:50.030 --> 00:11:53.830
N... Nice to meet you, sir. I'm
Natsumi Tsujimoto.

00:12:08.720 --> 00:12:13.850
Umm... I'll make sure your uniform is
returned cleaned and fresh... so...

00:12:14.860 --> 00:12:15.750
So what?

00:12:15.920 --> 00:12:17.410
I'm very sorry.

00:12:17.590 --> 00:12:19.680
I don't want you to mis-
understand me here.

00:12:19.790 --> 00:12:22.850
What I'm upset about
is your work ethic.

00:12:23.400 --> 00:12:26.390
How can you possibly consider your-
selves to be police officers?

00:12:26.500 --> 00:12:27.830
What is it?

00:12:28.000 --> 00:12:31.370
We've got a situation at the Yotsuki
bridge in the 4th district.

00:12:32.270 --> 00:12:36.230
An apparently drunk teenage
girl has climbed the bridge.

00:12:36.340 --> 00:12:38.810
All units report to the
scene immediately.

00:12:38.980 --> 00:12:40.840
Roger.

00:12:41.550 --> 00:12:43.420
What's the matter?! Didn't you hear?!

00:12:43.420 --> 00:12:44.280
Yes, sir!

00:12:44.280 --> 00:12:46.450
We'll head to the scene.

00:12:47.620 --> 00:12:49.210
Officer Tsujimoto.

00:12:49.390 --> 00:12:52.950
Yes, sir. How can
I help you?

00:12:54.330 --> 00:12:56.760
I will be going
as well.

00:12:56.930 --> 00:12:58.900
Huh?

00:13:06.140 --> 00:13:07.270
Bastard!

00:13:07.440 --> 00:13:11.140
This truck appears to have hit the
guardrail as the driver swerved...

00:13:11.250 --> 00:13:12.680
...to avoid a girl jumping
out onto the roadway.

00:13:12.780 --> 00:13:16.440
The girl's under the influence and
has climbed up the girders.

00:13:16.580 --> 00:13:17.420
Why?

00:13:17.420 --> 00:13:19.680
think she had a fight
with her boyfriend.

00:13:19.850 --> 00:13:22.290
Madoka! Come
down!

00:13:22.460 --> 00:13:22.560
Hey! Calm down.

00:13:22.560 --> 00:13:23.520
Madoka!

00:13:23.690 --> 00:13:27.750
Shut up! I've already decided
to kill myself, so go away!

00:13:28.260 --> 00:13:30.250
I'm going to become
a bird!

00:13:30.360 --> 00:13:34.930
Oh my, what a shame.
A girl drunk like that.

00:13:35.100 --> 00:13:36.240
Guess I fit in that category.

00:13:36.240 --> 00:13:37.170
Hey, you guys!

00:13:37.170 --> 00:13:37.760
Yes, sir!

00:13:37.940 --> 00:13:40.570
I don't want you to get involved
this time. Got that?

00:13:40.740 --> 00:13:41.440
Huh?

00:13:41.440 --> 00:13:42.910
Why not, sir?

00:13:43.080 --> 00:13:45.240
Well...

00:13:49.650 --> 00:13:53.110
There you go, so
stay out of it.

00:13:53.290 --> 00:13:53.790
Oh...

00:13:53.790 --> 00:13:54.810
Hey, Nakajima?

00:13:54.990 --> 00:13:55.920
Yes, sir.

00:13:56.090 --> 00:13:59.290
We're short-handed. Go on
up there and talk to her.

00:13:59.460 --> 00:14:03.060
Huh? You mean me?!
I'm no good at that.

00:14:03.160 --> 00:14:08.660
I'm not good with girls, and I've got a thing
about heights. I don't think I can...

00:14:09.500 --> 00:14:10.970
Damn...

00:14:11.070 --> 00:14:12.900
What am I supposed
to say?

00:14:13.010 --> 00:14:14.970
Jeez, this
is high!

00:14:16.840 --> 00:14:19.470
Okay! Now don't
confront her.

00:14:19.580 --> 00:14:21.550
Just be nice and calm.
Are you listening?

00:14:21.650 --> 00:14:25.410
I can hear you, but how
do I do that?

00:14:27.790 --> 00:14:30.920
What do you want? Why's
a cop coming up here?

00:14:31.430 --> 00:14:35.160
Well... ahh...
you see...

00:14:35.660 --> 00:14:37.060
[Hi! HoW are you today!]

00:14:37.060 --> 00:14:38.730
Oh, no...

00:14:38.900 --> 00:14:41.560
Just leave me
alone, okay?!

00:14:41.670 --> 00:14:43.640
I've decided to
kill myself.

00:14:43.800 --> 00:14:45.770
Well, we can't have
you doing that.

00:14:45.940 --> 00:14:48.840
I'd rather die when I'm
still lookin' pretty!

00:14:48.940 --> 00:14:52.500
There's no point in living
'til I'm an old hag.

00:14:52.780 --> 00:14:55.180
Oh, I see... well no,
what I meant was...

00:14:55.350 --> 00:14:57.280
Hey, how about a drink?

00:14:57.280 --> 00:14:58.190
No, I can't... uh...

00:14:58.190 --> 00:14:59.710
Then I'm going to die.

00:14:59.890 --> 00:15:02.980
Look, I understand...
Jeez, this is tough.

00:15:03.090 --> 00:15:04.990
Hey, guess what...
you know...

00:15:05.090 --> 00:15:07.750
How about we go down
and then have a drink?

00:15:07.930 --> 00:15:09.860
How 'bout a different
pickup line?

00:15:09.960 --> 00:15:12.160
I'm definitely not
going down.

00:15:12.400 --> 00:15:14.530
Your parents are worried
about you.

00:15:14.700 --> 00:15:16.790
This has nothing to do
with my Mom or Dad.

00:15:16.970 --> 00:15:18.140
How about your boyfriend?

00:15:18.140 --> 00:15:20.110
How about your boyfriend?
Daisuke?!

00:15:20.270 --> 00:15:27.650
He's an unfaithful jerk. Nobody
really cares about me.

00:15:27.980 --> 00:15:32.010
I suppose you might look
like a bit of a floozy...

00:15:32.120 --> 00:15:35.280
[... but it's not as if you've lost the
glitter in the gem of your soul.]

00:15:35.460 --> 00:15:36.190
[Oh, this sucks!]

00:15:36.190 --> 00:15:38.490
What the hell is he saying? He's not...

00:15:38.490 --> 00:15:39.560
[Why don't you sing me a song?]

00:15:39.560 --> 00:15:41.260
Detective Tokuno, I think I should...

00:15:41.360 --> 00:15:41.500
[Wait, I can't sing...]

00:15:41.500 --> 00:15:42.120
No way!

00:15:42.260 --> 00:15:42.300
[Okay, then I'll kill myself.]

00:15:42.300 --> 00:15:43.000
But...

00:15:43.000 --> 00:15:43.020
[Okay, then I'll kill myself.]

00:15:43.130 --> 00:15:44.460
Hey, Aoi!

00:15:44.460 --> 00:15:44.490
[Okay, I'll sing!]

00:15:44.600 --> 00:15:45.570
Yes, sir.

00:15:45.730 --> 00:15:48.390
You go up there as well. Nakajima's
not going to be able to resolve this.

00:15:48.900 --> 00:15:51.170
Yes, sir!

00:15:51.640 --> 00:15:52.570
What's this?

00:15:52.570 --> 00:15:54.770
Well...

00:15:55.480 --> 00:16:00.040
Don't do anything foolish. Focus
on getting the safety line on her.

00:16:00.210 --> 00:16:01.550
I understand.

00:16:01.550 --> 00:16:02.880
Are you okay?

00:16:03.050 --> 00:16:06.780
Yes. This is a lot more interesting
than chasing chikans.

00:16:13.930 --> 00:16:17.330
A little more, a little
more. Forward.

00:16:18.970 --> 00:16:21.940
You're godawful.
Whoa!

00:16:22.040 --> 00:16:23.830
That was dangerous.

00:16:24.240 --> 00:16:26.330
My poor
heart.

00:16:26.510 --> 00:16:27.770
What is it this
time?

00:16:27.940 --> 00:16:30.970
Hello... You two seem
to be having fun.

00:16:31.080 --> 00:16:33.310
Can I join
in?

00:16:33.580 --> 00:16:35.810
No way. Get
out of here!

00:16:36.050 --> 00:16:37.350
[Hey, Watch it!]

00:16:37.350 --> 00:16:38.340
[Shut up!]

00:16:38.520 --> 00:16:41.510
[I hate you all. Why don't you
just leave me alone?!]

00:16:41.690 --> 00:16:41.860
How's it going?

00:16:41.860 --> 00:16:43.060
[If you jump...]

00:16:43.060 --> 00:16:43.890
I think I did exactly the wrong thing.

00:16:43.890 --> 00:16:46.890
[... l'll feel bad.]

00:16:46.990 --> 00:16:50.930
[I can't tell you hoW much it hurts me already!]

00:16:51.300 --> 00:16:54.060
Ahh... I've had enough!
I'm going to die now.

00:16:54.230 --> 00:16:55.470
Don't say that.

00:16:55.470 --> 00:16:57.530
Do you have a girlfriend?

00:16:57.700 --> 00:16:59.900
Uh... well...
no...

00:17:00.070 --> 00:17:03.800
[You don't even have a girlfriend?
HoW can you knoW hoW I feel?]

00:17:03.980 --> 00:17:07.240
[Come on, that's
not true.]

00:17:07.410 --> 00:17:09.680
Yes? Yes, this
is Daisuke...

00:17:09.780 --> 00:17:15.280
That's right... Madoka's flipped out
and I can't do anything about it.

00:17:15.390 --> 00:17:20.290
I've gotta go to work, too. What a hassle.
A few dates and she's all serious.

00:17:20.390 --> 00:17:24.350
Talk about bad luck
with women.

00:17:24.460 --> 00:17:25.070
Yes... right. That's right.

00:17:25.070 --> 00:17:26.470
Don't do it, Natsumi!

00:17:26.470 --> 00:17:27.300
But...

00:17:27.300 --> 00:17:29.430
The Inspector is watching.

00:17:29.600 --> 00:17:32.400
This is really
lame...

00:17:37.880 --> 00:17:39.850
What the heck was
that for?!

00:17:41.780 --> 00:17:42.650
Natsumi...

00:17:42.820 --> 00:17:44.940
What are you talking about,
you little punk?!

00:17:45.050 --> 00:17:48.420
Don't you realize that all of this was
caused by your irresponsibility?!

00:17:49.060 --> 00:17:51.920
What do you mean, "lame?"
This isn't a TV show!

00:17:52.260 --> 00:17:54.990
Piss off. This has nothing
to do with you!

00:17:55.360 --> 00:17:59.660
It sure does! You're the one
who made this mess!

00:18:01.170 --> 00:18:05.770
You can't even take care of one girl,
but you act like...

00:18:05.940 --> 00:18:07.040
What?!

00:18:07.040 --> 00:18:08.370
That's enough now.

00:18:08.540 --> 00:18:12.640
Huh?! Guys like this never learn unless
they're knocked around a few times.

00:18:13.010 --> 00:18:16.380
Natsumi! It's not like he committed
a crime or anything.

00:18:16.550 --> 00:18:17.320
But...

00:18:17.320 --> 00:18:19.810
Come on, just settle down, okay?

00:18:22.360 --> 00:18:24.920
[It's true that
I'm old...]

00:18:25.030 --> 00:18:27.960
[... and that I may not knoW
hoW you feel right noW.]

00:18:28.060 --> 00:18:32.790
But I do know what it feels like
to really like someone.

00:18:32.900 --> 00:18:35.730
It's wonderful that we can feel
so strongly about someone.

00:18:35.840 --> 00:18:39.360
But it's not always about just
the fun and cool stuff, is it?

00:18:39.710 --> 00:18:43.730
At first, all you think about is how to get
that person to even glance at you.

00:18:43.840 --> 00:18:45.970
That's all you
think about.

00:18:46.080 --> 00:18:50.610
I'm awful at expressing my feelings, so I
goof up at that sort of thing, but...

00:18:50.720 --> 00:18:56.620
...it's important to not impose your
feelings onto the other person...

00:18:56.720 --> 00:19:01.680
...but first get an understanding of what
that other person's feelings are.

00:19:02.930 --> 00:19:06.700
I'm not very smart, so I don't
understand any of that.

00:19:07.170 --> 00:19:09.160
I don't understand it, either.

00:19:09.270 --> 00:19:11.360
That's why I keep on living.
I'm trying my best.

00:19:11.470 --> 00:19:13.800
[And I can do it because I knoW
that one day there'll be...]

00:19:13.910 --> 00:19:15.200
[... that understanding.]

00:19:15.640 --> 00:19:18.610
At least... that's
how I feel...

00:19:20.080 --> 00:19:22.670
[You're adorable.]

00:19:23.950 --> 00:19:24.520
Really?

00:19:24.520 --> 00:19:27.820
I feel all clear-headed and sober now.

00:19:27.990 --> 00:19:29.680
Maybe it's time to get
down off the bridge.

00:19:31.660 --> 00:19:33.390
Hooray!

00:19:33.560 --> 00:19:38.760
Right, we did it. Get ready
to bring them down.

00:19:43.600 --> 00:19:46.770
Don't panic now. She's just going
to come and pick you up.

00:19:46.940 --> 00:19:48.930
Okay.

00:19:49.210 --> 00:19:51.800
That's right...
slowly...

00:19:53.910 --> 00:19:55.940
Okay, that's
good.

00:19:58.890 --> 00:19:59.420
Carefully...

00:19:59.420 --> 00:20:01.150
Madoka!

00:20:01.150 --> 00:20:02.780
You moron!

00:20:04.320 --> 00:20:06.920
Look out!

00:20:08.500 --> 00:20:10.330
Miyuki! Get
the car!

00:20:10.500 --> 00:20:11.000
Got it!

00:20:11.000 --> 00:20:11.900
Hey! You!

00:20:11.900 --> 00:20:13.890
We'll talk later!

00:20:14.300 --> 00:20:16.700
Aoi! Hold
on tight!

00:20:27.650 --> 00:20:30.240
Hang on tight!
Don't let go!

00:20:35.460 --> 00:20:36.750
47 degrees,
30 kph!

00:20:36.920 --> 00:20:39.150
Gotcha! Nitro, ON!

00:20:53.510 --> 00:20:54.630
Ohh!

00:20:54.740 --> 00:20:57.230
This one's gonna
cost some.

00:20:57.940 --> 00:20:59.500
We did it!

00:20:59.680 --> 00:21:02.270
Way to go, Tsujimoto!
Whoahh!

00:21:04.380 --> 00:21:08.150
Sorry, car, I scratched
you up a bit again.

00:21:14.090 --> 00:21:16.220
Excuse me... excuse me...
please let me through...

00:21:16.330 --> 00:21:18.300
Excuse me...
Oh my!

00:21:20.400 --> 00:21:22.160
Hey.

00:21:22.340 --> 00:21:26.500
Inspector, were you here
to see all this?

00:21:26.970 --> 00:21:32.310
Yeah. Quite a shameless
bunch they are...

00:21:32.410 --> 00:21:33.810
...but...

00:21:33.980 --> 00:21:35.950
Sir?

00:21:36.120 --> 00:21:39.480
They're good officers.

00:21:40.320 --> 00:21:42.410
Thank you very
much, sir!

00:22:01.610 --> 00:22:10.180
<i>I live my life my own way, doing</i>
<i>things others wouldn't.</i>

00:22:10.450 --> 00:22:18.750
<i>Being strong isn't enough.</i>
<i>It makes me lonely.</i>

00:22:21.490 --> 00:22:29.740
<i>I can feel your presence</i>
<i>as if you're right here...</i>

00:22:30.270 --> 00:22:37.840
<i>... but I can't say a word.</i>

00:22:39.380 --> 00:22:46.690
<i>The feelings I hide within might</i>
<i>break into pieces...</i>

00:22:48.190 --> 00:22:55.600
<i>But if I don't say anything,</i>
<i>nothing can begin.</i>

00:22:55.900 --> 00:23:03.130
<i>The wind gently blows...</i>
<i>Time flows...</i>

00:23:08.110 --> 00:23:12.850
<i>Time flows... And soon</i>
<i>I can be honest...</i>

00:23:12.980 --> 00:23:15.950
<i>Thank you,</i>
<i>friend!</i>

00:23:22.190 --> 00:23:24.050
"Identity Unknown"

00:23:25.260 --> 00:23:26.590
Here comes the Hero of Justice!

00:23:26.590 --> 00:23:29.430
Justice? WE are on the side of Justice!

00:23:29.430 --> 00:23:30.930
What does he look like?

00:23:30.930 --> 00:23:33.230
Height about 180cm, well-built...

00:23:33.400 --> 00:23:35.900
...funny mask, so I couldn't see his eyes.

00:23:35.900 --> 00:23:37.870
And he appears on a bike like no other!

00:23:37.870 --> 00:23:38.970
Oh, aren't you talking about...

00:23:38.970 --> 00:23:39.630
Nakajima?!

00:23:39.810 --> 00:23:41.770
Oh, I got it! It's him!

00:23:43.140 --> 00:23:47.250
Next time, on You're Under Arrest, File 7,
"Strike Man - Defender of Justice?"

00:23:47.380 --> 00:23:49.380
It's not me,
I tell you!
